{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013aZdWaVXcQLAGhAFYNbdLj","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"25473cdc-0503-4b45-9076-b9d3fca79f4a","uuid":"ba0da421-eb3c-4b79-968c-3a8425380ac4","timestamp":"2026-06-10T17:01:10.937Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"- **\"may\" with single target:** per TODO, when exactly one legal instant/sorcery\n  is in the graveyard it is auto-selected (no prompt); with multiple, the player\n  picks via `choose_card` (or `None` to decline).","newString":"- **\"may\" with single target:** per TODO, when exactly one legal instant/sorcery\n  is in the graveyard it is auto-selected (no prompt); with multiple, the player\n  picks via `choose_card` (or `None` to decline).\n\n## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n- **Restricted mana (gap, additive):** added a per-type `_restricted` count to\n  `ManaPool`, an `add(..., restricted=True)` flag, and an `allow_restricted`\n  kwarg on `can_pay`/`pay` (default `True` → all existing behavior unchanged).\n  `cast_spell` passes `allow_restricted = card is instant/sorcery`. Models the\n  single restriction this card needs (\"instant/sorcery only\"); not a general\n  restriction subsystem.\n- **`AttacksTriggeredEvent` reuse:** the pump and combat rely on the\n  declare-attackers firing added for sos_1.\n- **Animation (gap, card-local):** the card subclasses `Land` (NOT `Creature`,\n  to avoid combat's `hasattr(base_power)` treating an un-animated land as an\n  attacker). `power`/`toughness` are properties that raise `AttributeError`\n  until animated, so combat/SBA `hasattr` checks skip the un-animated land.\n  `_animate` mutates in place: adds the CREATURE type (and updates\n  `_original_card_types` so it persists through effect resets), the Wizard\n  subtype, base 2/4, the creature runtime attrs, and registers the pump trigger.\n- **Pump \"+1/+0 until EOT\":** `apply_all` only runs at cleanup, so the pump\n  bumps `modified_power` directly (immediately visible) and the cleanup\n  effect-manager reset (`_reset_characteristics`) clears it — exactly the\n  until-end-of-turn duration.","originalFile":"# KEY_DECISIONS.md\n\nLightweight log of ambiguous-clause decisions, deviations from TODO.md, and\ndeliberate card-local engine limitations made during the SOS card build.\n\n## sos_1 — The Dawning Archaic\n- **Engine gap (additive):** `AttacksTriggeredEvent` was defined in events.py but\n  never fired anywhere. Added per-attacker firing in `declare_attackers_step`\n  (engine/combat.py). No-op when no trigger is registered, so existing tests\n  unaffected; this also makes FDN attack-trigger cards (Etali, Drakuseth) live.\n- **Exile-instead clause:** TODO suggested a `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent`\n  redirect, but the engine only consults replacement effects for permanents\n  *leaving the battlefield*, not for a spell resolving stack→graveyard. Per the\n  pitfalls' explicit preference (\"a flag/field read at the one right point\"), I\n  added a card-local `_resolve_to_zone` attribute read in `_resolve_spell`\n  (default graveyard, consumed after use). The Dawning Archaic sets it to\n  `Zone.EXILE` on the spell it casts for free.\n- **\"may\" with single target:** per TODO, when exactly one legal instant/sorcery\n  is in the graveyard it is auto-selected (no prompt); with multiple, the player\n  picks via `choose_card` (or `None` to decline).\n\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":19,"oldLines":3,"newStart":19,"newLines":24,"lines":["   is in the graveyard it is auto-selected (no prompt); with multiple, the player","   picks via `choose_card` (or `None` to decline)."," ","+## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex","+- **Restricted mana (gap, additive):** added a per-type `_restricted` count to","+  `ManaPool`, an `add(..., restricted=True)` flag, and an `allow_restricted`","+  kwarg on `can_pay`/`pay` (default `True` → all existing behavior unchanged).","+  `cast_spell` passes `allow_restricted = card is instant/sorcery`. Models the","+  single restriction this card needs (\"instant/sorcery only\"); not a general","+  restriction subsystem.","+- **`AttacksTriggeredEvent` reuse:** the pump and combat rely on the","+  declare-attackers firing added for sos_1.","+- **Animation (gap, card-local):** the card subclasses `Land` (NOT `Creature`,","+  to avoid combat's `hasattr(base_power)` treating an un-animated land as an","+  attacker). `power`/`toughness` are properties that raise `AttributeError`","+  until animated, so combat/SBA `hasattr` checks skip the un-animated land.","+  `_animate` mutates in place: adds the CREATURE type (and updates","+  `_original_card_types` so it persists through effect resets), the Wizard","+  subtype, base 2/4, the creature runtime attrs, and registers the pump trigger.","+- **Pump \"+1/+0 until EOT\":** `apply_all` only runs at cleanup, so the pump","+  bumps `modified_power` directly (immediately visible) and the cleanup","+  effect-manager reset (`_reset_characteristics`) clears it — exactly the","+  until-end-of-turn duration.","+"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
